      "comment": "LITTLE DAN (8) has a strong record this track and trip including three wins from five starts. Comes off a (26.00) win last time, scoring by half a length in a Grade 3/4 over 461m at Hobart. Expected to be in the finish. RED DAY (2) had been racing well without winning, recording four minors on end before copping a check in the run and finishing sixth in a Special conditions race at this track (30.13). Better than last start and can bounce back. DARLING DANGER (5) was well backed last start but ran below expectations when sixth (20.09), beaten 7 lengths. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. AEROPLANE BERNIE (1) is worth including after a top-three finish in slick time most recently.",
